Real Estate Price Prediction using Manual Neural Network

Dataset
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/188738/MLProjectAnuragKouthubGanugapatiGnaneshAndraHiteshAhirSaiesh/main/iowa_real_estate_intelligence_2026_v1.csv

How to Run
1. Install dependencies:
   pip install numpy pandas matplotlib
2. Open the notebook
3. Run all cells


This project implements a neural network from scratch using NumPy (no ML libraries) to predict real estate prices.
